# Shen'dralas - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Shen'dralas accept in the local census (28 quests, band 30-49,
# docs/shendralas-census.md, accept key 2652 verified by spawn counts) appears
# exactly once as an accept; 28 turnins close every record (all 28 have a
# turn-in in the data). The Horde-gated 93058/93062/93122/93128 block is out
# with reasons in the census. No race header and no race gates: all 28 are
# races=null (open). No class or skill gates anywhere (all null). Item
# objectives with no data-placed source ship as honest area notes naming the
# thing (R2); kill objectives and the data-placed pylons/events ride real
# completes. Soft pres ride dedicated when-onquest minis: 93034 (Desolace
# accept, turnin Nerlokh here) and 93066 (Desolace accept, turnin Hagiak
# here); both turnins are documented non-contract lines, Silithus precedent.
# Expedition tail groups the Desolace-frame objectives (11559 kills, Uthek
# turnin) with frame switches (R1).

guide butler-routes-completionist/shendralas
title Shen'dralas
levels 30-49
zone Shen'dralas
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Kalimdor
coords live
version 1

step Nerlokh camp arrival (when onquest 93034)

  zone map 2652

  when onquest 93034
  note Valley of Bones (93034) accepts from Uthek the Wise in Desolace, outside this contract - the Desolace guide routes it here. This step carries that handoff and nothing else.
  turnin 93034 -- Valley of Bones - to Nerlokh (20.93, 22.68); holders turn in here, others skip - this unlocks Ravaging Ravagers and Outing Outcasts below

step Nerlokh camp - Ravaging Ravagers and Outing Outcasts

  zone map 2652

  tip Arriving from Desolace down the Maraudon descent, Nerlokh's camp in the west is the hub: Nerlokh at (20.93, 22.68). This leg clears his openers and picks up the Uthek delivery for the end of the route.
  accept 93035 -- Ravaging Ravagers - Nerlokh (20.93, 22.68)
  turnin 93035 -- Ravaging Ravagers - back to Nerlokh
  accept 93037 -- Outing Outcasts - Nerlokh (20.93, 22.68)
  turnin 93037 -- Outing Outcasts - back to Nerlokh
  accept 93041 -- Facing the Truth - Nerlokh (20.93, 22.68); for Uthek the Wise in Desolace - carried on the expedition below
  note Magram Necromancers (253272) prowl the west, e.g. (24.55, 24.24) - Tattered Journal (item 260347) drops there and starts Tattered Journal, turned in at Mordent in the halls below; Outcast Necromancers in Desolace (the expedition below) drop it too

step Hagiak camp - Long-Term Solutions (when onquest 93066)

  zone map 2652

  when onquest 93066
  note Bristleback Retreat (93066) accepts from Orgrul in Desolace, outside this contract - the Desolace guide routes it here. This step carries that handoff and nothing else.
  turnin 93066 -- Bristleback Retreat - to Hagiak (59.27, 53.93); holders turn in here, others skip - this unlocks Long-Term Solutions and Threat of Starvation below

step Hagiak camp - Threat of Starvation and the Outcast kills

  zone map 2652

  accept 93129 -- Threat of Starvation - Hagiak (59.27, 53.93)
  turnin 93129 -- Threat of Starvation - back to Hagiak
  accept 93072 -- Long-Term Solutions - Hagiak (59.27, 53.93); Outcast Scouts and Marauders around the camp, Outcast Necromancers (11559) live in Desolace - carried on the expedition below
  complete 93072 @46.44,58.86 -- Outcast Scouts west of the camp
  complete 93072 @48.93,54.14 -- Outcast Marauders around the camp

