step Desolace expedition - necromancers and Uthek

  zone map 1443

  note Leaving Shen'dralas south into Desolace for the two out-of-zone legs, then back. Frame switches here and back.
  complete 93072 @59.88,89.88 -- 8 Outcast Necromancers in the south of Desolace
  turnin 93041 -- Facing the Truth - to Uthek the Wise (36.22, 79.25); this feeds the Desolace-contracted A Cleansing Cry, which the Desolace guide routes

step Hagiak return - Orgrul handoff

  zone map 2652

  note Back inside Shen'dralas. Frame is home again.
  turnin 93072 -- Long-Term Solutions - to Hagiak (59.27, 53.93)
  accept 93188 -- Return to Orgrul - Hagiak (59.27, 53.93)
  turnin 93188 -- Return to Orgrul - to Orgrul (35.71, 12.66); this feeds the Desolace-contracted Khan Jehn, which the Desolace guide routes. Orgrul also offers the Desolace-contracted Orgrul chain (92844 and followers) - see the Desolace guide, never accepted here.

